    {
        "content": "<p>I think I should give more context. This would be appear as the Jacobian in change-of-variables formula between different dimensions. It is also very related to <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Matrix.gram#doc\">docs#Matrix.gram</a>, but it is independent of matrix/basis</p>",
